                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/E892518033457D47B645F2E3874AAEDD/7fc5e5d73de3744e723c116062e6c02f_512.webp" alt="亞歷山卓萬聖節髮飾好Q　粉紅骷髏、水晶南瓜優雅搞怪" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                                    <svg viewBox="0 0 51 51" style="position: absolute; right: 10px; bottom: 10px; width: 40px; opacity: 0.8;">
                                    <path id="_Color" d="M25.5,51A25.5,25.5,0,1,1,51,25.5,25.529,25.529,0,0,1,25.5,51ZM15.3,22.95l10.2,10.2,10.2-10.2Z" transform="translate(0 51) rotate(-90)" fill="#fff"/>
                                    </svg>
                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/entertainment/20261019/E892518033457D47B645F2E3874AAEDD">亞歷山卓萬聖節髮飾好Q　粉紅骷髏、水晶南瓜優雅搞怪</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者劉旻君／台北報導】再過兩個禮拜即將迎來萬聖節，法國精品髮飾亞歷山卓（Alexandre de Paris）也推出全新2026萬聖節限定系列髮飾，包括南瓜笑臉、黑貓、蝙蝠等元素都融入設計，連骷髏頭都換上粉紅外衣並綴滿水晶，讓搞怪萬聖節造型也能散發法式優雅氣息。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category entertainment">娛樂時尚</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:26:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:26</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/14C7A34BE3B29A243C042D2E959ED278">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/14C7A34BE3B29A243C042D2E959ED278/0b1d2181d372975b6e3ead9e9ad908ee_512.webp" alt="盧秀燕明飛日本沖繩訪問2天　飛機上為66對新人高空證婚" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/14C7A34BE3B29A243C042D2E959ED278">盧秀燕明飛日本沖繩訪問2天　飛機上為66對新人高空證婚</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【記者鮮明／台中報導】台中市長盧秀燕今（19日）接任台北市長蔣萬安競選總部主委，中市府隨即宣布，盧秀燕明天一早將率團從台中出發赴日本沖繩，在飛機上為66對新人證婚，同時拜會沖繩縣政府與當地台商，預計21日返抵台中。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:26:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:26</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                        <article class="post-style1" itemscope="" itemprop="post">
                                                <a href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/15DE05C1CB703FE1B2734BDAD6158EB5">
                            <figure>
                                                                    <img data-src="https://static-cdn.nextapple.tw/prod/2026-10/15DE05C1CB703FE1B2734BDAD6158EB5/6625dcf4d467ba78a33ba92e4afd87a4_512.webp" alt="藍修法推「離島國際醫療專區」　鄭運鵬曝3大矛盾：你放心進去手術嗎？" src="data:image/jpeg;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=">
                                                                                            </figure>
                        </a>
                        <div class="post-inner">
                            <div>
                                <h3 itemprop="name" style="display:contents;">
                                    <a class="post-title" href="https://news.nextapple.com/politics/20261019/15DE05C1CB703FE1B2734BDAD6158EB5">藍修法推「離島國際醫療專區」　鄭運鵬曝3大矛盾：你放心進去手術嗎？</a>
                                </h3>
                                <p>【李家穎／綜合報導】國民黨加速推動修法，規劃在離島設置國際醫療專區，引進國際資金與醫療資源，引發討論。前立委鄭運鵬近日針對相關政策提出質疑，認為即使暫時不討論是否引進中國醫事人員，光是專區如何營運、如何獲利，以及如何保障離島居民的醫療權益，就存在不少問題，直言這項政策恐怕沒有想像中簡單。</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="post-meta">
                                <div class="category politics">政治</div>
                                <time datetime="2026-10-19T18:20:00+08:00">2026/10/19 18:20</time>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                                                </div>
        </div>
